# Scratch output of the standalone tests in core/tests -- none of it belongs in the repo.
#
# FileDownload_curl_test.cpp defaults its scratch directory to "." (its main() takes it as argv[1]),
# so running the .exe from wherever you happen to be leaves dl/, dl-other/, dl-broken-other/,
# curl_test_source.txt and a family of curl_test_* folders THERE. That is how they ended up loose in
# api/src/cpp on 2026-09-14. Run it from this folder, or pass this folder as argv[1].
#
# Nothing here is ignored by any other rule, so without this file `git add -A` would commit it --
# and the repo's own CLAUDE.md warns never to run that in this tree anyway.
*
!.gitignore
